  from the volkswagen contract and a race  car design that porsche and rosenberger  developed  company profits in 1935 neared the  equivalent of 1.5 million us dollars  today  to understand what happened next to  rosenberger it helps to explain the  concept of arionizing assets in nazi  germany  while porsche's cars were in demand the  company had a problem that many  companies in nazi germany faced the nazi  regime wanted to aryanize businesses by  removing any jewish owners  to achieve this goal of aryanization  many companies began buying out  jewish-owned assets often for less than  their actual value or through outright  theft since adolf rosenberger had a 10  stake in porsche the family had to buy  him out  the 10 stack that he has in the in in  the porsche company  is bought out at the nominal value at 3  000 price mark which was the  nominal value of his  seed capital  of the porsche company  in december 1930.  even though profits of the porsche car  design firm have greatly increased  in the years since they are no longer on  the verge of bankruptcy adolf  rosenberger ends up selling his shares  to his co-founders  far below the market value his 10 steak  is transferred to ferry porsche who is  the only son of farin and porsche and  his wife  rosenberger later said that while he did  not directly accuse porsche and piek of  anti-semitism they quote used my  membership as a jew to get rid of me  cheaply  ten days before the nuremberg race laws  were enacted in september of 1935  rosenberger was arrested by the gestapo  and charged with race defilement for  having dated a non-jewish woman  after spending almost three weeks in  prison rosenberger was transferred to a  concentration camp on september 23 1935.  he endured four days of beatings and was  then suddenly released  baron hans von weider mahlberg  rosenberger's successor at porsche had  intervened with the gestapo and lobbied  for his freedom  but neither ferdinand porsche nor anton  piek did anything 